    "faqItems": [["What is Woonwekker?","Woonwekker helps you discover and compare rental homes in the Netherlands. Filter by place, monthly rent and number of bedrooms and view available photos."],["Are the homes still available?","The overview contains 770 listings from a file dated 24 September 2026. Supply and prices may have changed. Always check the current status via the “View original listing” button."],["How do I schedule a viewing?","Open a home and go via “View original listing” to the original ad. Contact the provider there. Woonwekker does not schedule viewings or handle rental applications."],["Is the shown price inclusive of all costs?","The price is the monthly rent from the supplied file. Service costs, energy, deposit and other terms are not known for every home. Ask the provider for a full cost overview."],["Do I have to pay to search?","With Kijken (€0) you browse free teasers of rental homes. With Bellen (€18.50/mo) you unlock full details, the source link (Funda etc.), unlimited email+WhatsApp alerts, search buddy and reply kit. 1-click cancel, 14-day money-back, no trial. Rental agreements are always made with the provider."],["Can I search in my own language?","Yes. Choose Nederlands, English, Español or Polski in the language menu. Interface, FAQ and legal information change with it. Addresses and names from the source remain unchanged."],["Why does a home have only a few photos?","The supplied overview contains one to six photos per home. The original listing may have more photos and additional details."],["Will I get notifications of new homes?","Yes, via search profiles in your account. With Kijken: max 3 email alerts per week. With Bellen (€18.50/mo): unlimited email + WhatsApp (target <60s). Set up to 4 search profiles under Account. The dataset itself is a snapshot (see date); alerts are a product demo on this device."],["What if I find an error or suspicious listing?","Check the original listing and report incorrect data to the provider or source platform. Do not transfer money based on an ad alone; verify identity and agreements before paying."]],
    "legalSections": [["about","About Woonwekker","Woonwekker is a home-search concept by Vorxeo AI. This website shows a manager-supplied overview of rental homes. Woonwekker is not the landlord or agent and does not conclude rental agreements via this website.","Operator: Vorxeo. Chamber of Commerce number 42108778. VAT number NL005499683B86. Contact: support@vorxeo.com."],["terms","Terms of use","You may use the overview to discover and compare homes. Shown monthly rent, features and availability may differ from the current situation. The original provider confirms final terms.","Contact, viewings and any agreements take place outside Woonwekker. We do not process reservations, payments or rental applications here. Information on this website is not a binding offer or personal legal advice. Statutory consumer rights remain applicable.","Photos, listing texts and brand names remain the property of their respective rights holders. Viewing this overview does not grant the right to republish these materials. External links take you to websites with their own terms and privacy policy."],["privacy","Privacy statement","Search filters are applied exclusively in your browser. This website has no registration form, ad trackers or own analytics. Your language choice is stored locally on your device to restore the chosen language on a next visit.","When opening pages and photos the hosting service and external image server receive technical data such as IP address, browser type and time, for delivery and security of the content. Photos are loaded from an external image server. When following an external link the privacy policy of that website applies. Exact hosting retention periods and any international transfers must be confirmed before public launch.","To the extent personal data are processed, under the GDPR you may among other things request access, rectification, erasure, restriction or portability and object where applicable. You may lodge a complaint with the Dutch Data Protection Authority. The responsible company and contact point for these requests must be completed before public launch.","Favourites are stored exclusively on this device until you delete them or clear browser data. Your comparison remains available only in this browser session."],["cookies","Cookies and local storage","The website code does not place advertising or analytics cookies. Your language preference is stored under the key woonwekker-language in localStorage until you clear browser data or remove the preference below. The hosting environment may use necessary security or access mechanisms.","You can view the overview without creating a Woonwekker account. No searches or preferences are sent to a Woonwekker database. A private hosting environment may separately require access.","Favourites are stored exclusively on this device until you delete them or clear browser data. Your comparison remains available only in this browser session."]],
